  "bio": "Vitor Arkiro, a master of the fineline tattoo style, skillfully combines elements of nature and human connection within each intricate design. Based in London, United Kingdom, and a resident artist at Femme Fatale Tattoo, Vitor's work is sought-after for its precision and delicate detail. If you're looking for someone to craft a tattoo with finesse and an eye for subtlety, booking an appointment with Vitor is a decision you won't regret.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: London, England, United Kingdom",
